  "details": "## Description\n\nNot necessarily a bug but a feature request.\n\nPlease make it clear in the client that in-client reported bugs will be posted publicly to feedback.vrchat.com before submission. The UI doesn't currently state anything about this.\n\n## Reproduction Steps\n\n1. In VRChat 20256.3.1 (OPEN BETA) Build 1878 or later, navigate to Main Menu, Debug, Report a bug.\n\n2. Check the UI. Notice there's no privacy notice or a mention about submitted bug reports becoming public.\n\n3. Submit a bug report in-client or check https://feedback.vrchat.com/client-bug-reporting?sort=new\n\n## Details\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1881-ac10ed3a53-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR",
